--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Mozc dictionary data (assets/ondevice.dic)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The on-device kana-kanji conversion dictionary shipped as
`app/src/main/assets/ondevice.dic` is generated from the open-source dictionary
data of the Mozc project (https://github.com/google/mozc), specifically
`src/data/dictionary_oss/` — the vocabulary, part-of-speech definitions and
connection cost matrix.

