--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Stroke glyph shapes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The single-stroke glyph set is modelled on the unistroke input method popularised
by 1990s PDAs. The relevant patents (including US 5,596,656, "Unistrokes for
computerized interpretation of handwriting") have expired. Glyph shapes were
derived from reference-card diagrams published on Wikimedia Commons.

